{"id":"658248","name":"青椒炒牛肉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658248/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"300g"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"3个"},{"name":"姜丝","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉切成片。","img":"images/658248/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入鸡蛋一个搅拌均匀。","img":"images/658248/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒去掉头部切成小块。","img":"images/658248/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入锅里煸炒，放入盐拌匀。","img":"images/658248/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/658248/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉片放入红薯粉抓匀包裹住肉片。","img":"images/658248/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"油热以后，放入小米辣丝和姜丝爆香。","img":"images/658248/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入牛肉片定型一下。","img":"images/658248/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀变色。","img":"images/658248/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入煸炒过的青椒丝翻炒。","img":"images/658248/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入盐翻炒均匀。","img":"images/658248/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/658248/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/658248/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}